--- Handbook for Warts Molluscum and other Viral Infections ---
•    Viral infections, e.g. viral wart (see E pp. 160–1) or molluscum contagiosum (see $clubsuit$ p. 158). •    Nodular prurigo (caused by chronic rubbing) (see E Fig. 10.6, p. 223). •    Epidermal naevus (warty lesion, present since infancy) (see E p. 560).  •    Viral infections, e.g. viral wart (see E pp. 160–1) or molluscum contagiosum (see $\clubsuit$ p. 158). •    Nodular prurigo (caused by chronic rubbing) (see E Fig. 10.6, p. 223). •    Epidermal naevus (warty lesion, present since infancy) (see E p. 560).
